---
title: How do I check the activities of a quotation?
sidebar:
  order: 5
---
**To check the activities of an invoice, follow these steps:**

1. **Navigate to the “quotations” Section:**

   - **Click on the quotations tab on the left-hand sidebar.**

1. **Select the quotation to Preview:**

   - **Locate the quotation for which you want to see the activities.**
   - **Click on the three dots (⋮) next to the quotation.**
   - **From the dropdown menu, select “Preview quotation”.**

1. **View quotation Details and Activities:**

   - **In the quotation preview page, scroll down to the “Activities” section on the right-hand side.**
   - **Here, you’ll see a timeline of all activities related to the quotation, such as status changes, updates.**

**This timeline provides a detailed history of actions taken on that particular quotation.**
